cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "metalens-information-design"
abstract: >-
  Differentiable forward model and target-information objective for a metalens
  designed behind an RGGB colour filter array. Includes three published width
  maps, a script that reproduces their target information, and command-line
  tools for optimizing and simulating a metalens camera.
type: software
